Notice for data/mef_outlines_subset.npz

The file holds 1,200 of the 5,377 mouse embryonic fibroblast outlines (120
unordered points each) that Hugger & Uhlmann prepared for Shape Analysis 101
(BSD-3; see LICENSE in this repository) from the Micropattern_MEF_LMNA_Image
dataset by Kyu Sang Han, https://github.com/kukionfr/Micropattern_MEF_LMNA_Image,
which is distributed under the MIT License reproduced below.  The outlines are
redistributed here under that license and this notice; the subset was chosen
with a fixed seed (600 wild-type, 600 LMNA-/-), converted from (row, col) to
(x, y) and stored as float32 (see ATTRIBUTION.md).

